{
  "name": "OI · Vigilancia de las webs de cliente",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Cada 15 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0059",
      "position": [
        260,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lista de webs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0060",
      "position": [
        500,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Web a web",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0061",
      "position": [
        740,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Llamar a la web",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0062",
      "position": [
        980,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluar respuesta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const w = $('Web a web').first().json;\nconst t0 = $execution.customData?.t0 ?? Date.now();\nconst code = $json.statusCode ?? 0;\nconst caida = code !== 200;\nreturn [{ json: { cliente: w.cliente, url: w.url, code, caida,\n  cuando: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' ') } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0063",
      "position": [
        1220,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "¿Se cayó?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "oi-0011",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.caida }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0064",
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alerta al móvil",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "TU_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=🚨 <b>{{ $json.cliente }}</b> no responde\\n{{ $json.url }}\\nCódigo: {{ $json.code }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Telegram Bot (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0065",
      "position": [
        500,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Registrar incidencia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {},
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0066",
      "position": [
        740,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Todo correcto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "oi-0067",
      "position": [
        980,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oi-0068",
      "name": "Ficha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 🚨 Vigilancia de las webs de cliente\n**auto-monitor-webs**\n\nComprueba que cada web de cliente responde, mide cuánto tarda y avisa si algo se cae o si el certificado está por caducar.\n\n**Disparador:** Programado · cada 15 minutos\n\n**Coste: 0 €** — n8n autoalojado · Google Sheets · Telegram Bot · Gmail SMTP\n\n- Lee la lista de webs desde una hoja\n- Hace una petición a cada una sin cortar el flujo si falla\n- Marca como incidencia el código distinto de 200 o más de 4 s de respuesta\n- Avisa por Telegram al instante y deja el registro en la hoja"
      }
    }
  ],
